⍝ ---- the outside world
⸫ ᚨ ⟨ ◌ʃ ⊸ ℤ ⟩ «gra_htirt» ⎔
⎔ »elif_daer_htirt« ⟨ ⟗ʃ ⊸ ◌ʃ ⟩ ᚠ ⸫

⍝ ---- bytes and code points
ᛒ s i: byte i of s (from 0) as ℤ, or −1 past either end ⍝
⦃ ⧖ ⧖ ⧗⁰ ⧗¹ ⧗⁰ ⍴̱ △ ≫ ⊟ ⌖̱ ⁇ ⦃ ⚇ ⦄ ⦃ ▽ ⦄ ⦄ ⟨ ⟗ʃ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ⟩ ᛒ ⸫

⍝ ᚳ a i: element i (from 0) of an array whose element 0 is a sentinel; −1 past the end
⸫ ᚳ ⟨ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ⟦ ℤ ⟧ ⟗ ⟩ ⦃ ⦃ ▽ ⦄ ⦃ ⦄ ⁇ ⌖̱ ⊟ ≫ △ ⍴̱ ⧗⁰ ⊞ △ ⧗¹ ⧗⁰ ⧖ ⧖ ⦄

ᚴ a: number of elements after the sentinel ⍝
⦃ ⍴̱ △ ⊟ ⦄ ⟨ ⟗ ⟦ ℤ ⟧ ⊸ ℤ ⟩ ᚴ ⸫

⍝ ᛝ s i b0: the code point of a multi-byte UTF-8 sequence led by b0, and its length
⦄
  ⧖ ⧖ ⧖
  ⧗⁰ s  ⧗¹ i  ⧗² b0 ⍝
  ⧗² △▽△▽○△ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ▽△ ⦄ ⦃ ○△ ⦄ ⦃ ▽△ ⦄
  ⧖ ⊞ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⋔ ≶ ▽▽○○○△ ⧗²
  ⍝ ⧗⁰ n  ⧗¹ s  ⧗² i  ⧗³ b0; the loop carries [s i n k cp]
  ⋒ ≫ ⧗⁰ △○▽▽▽△ ⧗³ △ ⧗⁰ ⧗² ⧗¹
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖ ⧖ ⧖ ⧖ ⧖
    ⍝ ⧗⁰ s  ⧗¹ i  ⧗² n  ⧗³ k  ⧗⁴ cp
    ⊞ △ ⧗³ ⧗² ⧗¹ ⧗⁰
    ⧗⁴ ○▽△ ≪ ⧗⁰ ⧗¹ ⧗³ ⊞ ᛒ ○○△▽△ ⋒ ⋓
    ≶ ⊞ △ ⧗³ ⧗²
  ⦄
  ⧗⁰ ⧗¹ ⌁̱ ⌁ ⧖ ⌁ ⧖
⦄ ⟨ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ⟩ ᛝ ⸫

⍝ ᛑ s i: the code point starting at byte i, and its length in bytes
⦄
  ⧖ ⧖ ⧗⁰ ⧗¹ ⧗⁰ ⧗¹ ᛒ △○▽▽▽△ ⍿¹ ≶ ⋔
    ⦃ △ ⧗⁰ ⌁̱ ⌁ ⧖ ⦄
    ⁼
    ⦃ ᛝ ⦄
⦄ ⟨ ⟗ʃ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ⟩ ᛑ ⸫

⍝ ᛞ s: the code points of s, after a sentinel; s must not be empty
⦄
  ⟦ ○ ⟧ ○ ⥀ ⦃
    the loop carries [s cps i] ⍝
    ⧖ ⍿¹ ⧗⁰ ᛑ ⧖ ⍆̵ ⧗¹ ⧗⁰ ⊞ ⍿² ⍴̱ ⍿¹ ≶
  ⦃
  ⌁ ⧖ ⌁̱ ⧗⁰
⸫ ᛞ ⟨ ⟦ ℤ ⟧ ⊸ ⟗ʃ ⟩ ⦃

ᚦ str cp: append the UTF-8 encoding of cp ≥ 128 ⍝
⦃
  ⧖
  ⍝ ⧗⁰ cp; the stack holds [str]
  ⧖ ⊞ ▽△ ⊞ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⋔ ≶ ○▽△○▽○○○△○△ ⧗⁰ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⋔ ≶ △△▽△△▽○△ ⧗⁰
  ⍝ ⧗⁰ n  ⧗¹ cp
  ⍆̵ ⋓ ≫ ⊠ ⊟ △ ⧗⁰ ○▽△ ⧗¹ ⋒ ○△△○○△ ≪ ⊟ ⧗⁰ ▽○△ ○△△○○△
  ⧗¹ ⧗⁰ ▽△ ⊟ ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖ ⧖
    ⍝ ⧗⁰ cp  ⧗¹ k; the stack holds [str]
    ⍆̵ ⋓ ▽△▽▽▽△ ⋒ ○○△▽△ ≫ ⊠ ⧗¹ ○▽△ ⧗⁰
    ⧗⁰ ⧗¹ △ ⊟ ⍿⁰ ▽ ≶
  ⦃
  ⌁ ⌁
⸫ ᚦ ⟨ ʃ ⊸ ℤ ʃ ⟩ ⦃

ᚢ cp: print one code point ⍝
⦃ ⧖ »« ⧗⁰ ⧗⁰ △○▽▽▽△ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⍆̵ ⦄ ⦃ ᚦ ⦄ ⦃ ⍆̵ ⦄ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⟨ ℤ ⊸ ⟩ ᚢ ⸫

⍝ ᛂ n: print n > 0 in decimal
⦄
  ⧖
  ⧗⁰ n; r is n mod 10 in 0 … 9 ⍝
  ⧗⁰ △○△ ⊜ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⍿⁰ ○ ≶ ⋔ ∅ ∅ ⦃ △○△ ⊞ ⦄ ⧖
  ⧗⁰ r  ⧗¹ n ⍝
  ⧗¹ ⧗⁰ ⊟ △○△ ⊘ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⍿⁰ ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ᛂ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄
  ⎙̵ ⍆̵ ⊞ ○△▽▽△ ⧗⁰ «»
⦄ ⟨ ℤ ⊸ ⟩ ᛂ ⸫

⍝ ᛁ n: print n in decimal
⸫ ᛁ ⟨ ⊸ ℤ ⟩ ⦃ ⦃ ᛂ ⊝ ⎙̵ «-» ⦄ ⦃ ᛂ ⦄ ⦃ ⎙̵ «0» ⌁ ⦄ ⋔ ≶ ○ ⧗⁰ ⧗⁰ ⧖ ⦄

---- tests: ⦶ means yes, ⊕ means no (so ⋏ is "or" and ⋎ is "and") ⍝
⍝ ᛖ a b: a = b
⸫ ᛖ ⟨ ŧ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ⟩ ⦃ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⋔ ≶ ⦄
⍝ ᛦ cp lo hi: lo ≤ cp ≤ hi
⸫ ᛦ ⟨ ŧ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⟩ ⦃ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⋔ ⋏ ≶ ⧗⁰ ⧗² ≶ ⧗¹ ⧗⁰ ⧖ ⧖ ⧖ ⦄
⍝ ᛈ cps: print every code point
⸫ ᛈ ⟨ ⊸ ⟦ ℤ ⟧ ⟗ ⟩ ⦃ ⌁̱ ⌁ ⦃ ≶ ⍿¹ ᚴ ⍿¹ ⊞ △ ⧗¹ ⧗⁰ ᚢ ᚳ ⧗¹ ⧗⁰ ⧖ ⧖ ⦄ ⥀ ○ ⦄
⍝ ᛟ: decode a string with multi-byte code points, print it back and count them,
then fail to read a file that does not exist ⍝
⦃
  ᛞ ⟗ «ko⍝ℤŧ»
  ⟗ ᛈ »↵« ⎙̵
  ⎙̵ «↵» ᛁ ᚴ ⟗
  ○△△△▽ ᛁ »↵« ⎙̵
  ⌁̵ ⌁̵
  »htirt/tnetsixenon/« ⟗ ᚠ ⁇ ⦃ ⌁̵ »↵daer« ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ »↵elif on« ⎙̵ ⦄ ⌁̵
⸱ ⸫ ᛟ ⟨ ⊸ ⟩ ⦃
